OL,3,GNEWSAMiners' lamp collection goes under
OL,4,Ahammer
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn extensive collection of miners'
OL,7,Flamps, collected by one man over his
OL,8,Flifetime, is going under the hammer.
OL,10,FBob Batey's interest in the lamps was
OL,11,Fsparked at the age of 21 when his
OL,12,Ffather-in-law gave him his, and he went
OL,13,Fon to become an avid collector,
OL,14,Frestorer and researcher, building a
OL,15,Fnetwork of fellow enthusiasts that
OL,16,Fstretched across the world.
OL,18,FHis family said he was writing a book
OL,19,Fwhen he died and would have loved the
OL,20,Fthought of the lamps finding new homes
OL,21,Fwith people who cared about them as
OL,22,Fmuch as he did.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
